   "text": "rating ≥ 4 → positive\nusers with ≥ 20 interactions\none positive + one negative\nper user; 15% of users = test\ntop-50 items retrieved for ESU\n\nDIN: latest items\nSIM-hard: same tag\nSIM-soft: ID-embedding top-k",
   "fontSize": 21,
   "fontFamily": 5,
